<title>DENMARK: GN Store Nord 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>GN Store Nord 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group result before tax and ext.items  213.0 vs 184.0</p>
<p> Group net result				 144 vs 128</p>
<p> Group net turnover			   2,722 vs 2,137</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent)		  12  vs 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish cable-laying and telecoms group is GN Store Nord A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a better profit before tax and extraordinary items in 1997 than in 1996. The result was in line with average analyst expectations of a pre-tax profit of 215 million crowns for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
